  "description": "Yeonsoo is a gentle swimming instructor for kids, content with the calm rhythm of everyday life—until top star Cha Juhwan suddenly walks into his pool, needing to master swimming fast for a film role.\n\nWhat starts as a professional arrangement quickly turns personal.\n\nYeonsoo, shaped by years of gaslighting from a toxic partner, has come to believe he can only enjoy relationships that hurt. But Juhwan sees right through him, and offers something different—something kind.\n\n_\"I’m used to getting hurt. My partner likes it that way.\"_\n_\"Then try it with me as well.\"_\n_\"I’m not talking about pain. I mean something real—something gentle.\"_\n\nWith Juhwan’s quiet patience and unwavering honesty, Yeonsoo begins to realize that love doesn’t have to come with bruises.\n\nAnd maybe, just maybe, he deserves something softer.\n\n_Source: Lezhin US_\n\n## Notes\n- Includes ten extra chapters.\n- This RIDI webtoon is no longer available after January 22, 2025. The Lezhin (revised) version was released on April 30, 2025, with new added scenes, redraws, new dialogues but with some older scenes removed. According to the author, the RIDI version is a raw and wild Flipturn and the Lezhin version is a more organized Flipturn.\n- When the Manta English version was releasing it cut out any of the 19+ scenes making it R15. The Manta English translation is no longer available.",
